{"channelId":"UC8rl7RUfiufmngXNXtJCyNA","row":["Dr. Justine Lee, DACVECC, DABT",4130,"Dr. Justine Lee, DACVECC, DABT, is an emergency critical care veterinary specialist and toxicologist. She is also the founder of VETgirl, a subscription-based podcast & webinar service providing RACE-approved, online veterinary continuing education (CE). She's the author of two humorous Q:A pet books called \"It's a Dog's Life... but It's your Carpet\" and \"It's a Cat's World... You Just Live In It. She's the former blogger for PetMD, Pet Health Network and the former pet columnist for Prevention magazine. She lectures throughout the world. More information can be found at www.drjustinelee.com and www.vetgirlontherun.com.\n\nDisclaimer: Please note that this content has been made available for informational and educational purposes only. This content is not intended to be a substitute for professional advice, diagnosis, or treatment.  Do not delay treatment based on this content, and when in doubt, seek professional veterinary advice.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8rl7RUfiufmngXNXtJCyNA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8rl7RUfiufmngXNXtJCyNA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:36.063Z","channelId":"UC8rl7RUfiufmngXNXtJCyNA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"b081526449fa5d52860ca4ea218c8fef9b32c0cd4ea09fed981e02991e59d418","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"8737f794ab25397c65200fae854d46424a8d33dfbd2accfca55e336b8f13eb64"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8rl7RUfiufmngXNXtJCyNA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:36.063Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8rl7RUfiufmngXNXtJCyNA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":4130,"raw":"4.13K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8rl7RUfiufmngXNXtJCyNA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:36.063Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"ma